# Copy to `.env` (which is gitignored) and fill in ONLY if you use wandb online.
# Never commit real secrets. Prefer `wandb login` (stores the key in ~/.netrc,
# outside this repo) over putting the key here.
#
# Load these into your shell before an online run, e.g.:
#   set -a && source .env && set +a
#   python train.py writer.mode=online

# WANDB_API_KEY=
# WANDB_ENTITY=
# WANDB_MODE=offline
